Z||000009||mrfiero||08-25-2000||03:45 PM||||Man....I'm going to have to post all of my Fieros (past & present).....I've owned one of each color except blue!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ross,<P>While it is unusual for a gray interiored GT to get gold wheels, it isn't too uncommon.  I have seen several equipped like that.  I have also seen tan interiored GT's with black wheels......for the most part the wheels were supposed to match the interior.  That is, the tan interiored cars were supposed to get gold wheels and vice versa.  Some people special ordered theirs with black or gold, which is why cars like yours have "mis-matched" wheels.<P>If that GT had tan leather interior I would have bought it!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <P>Take good care or her.<P>||||reg||10
