Z||000067||JAMIE||01-03-2001||11:41 AM||||Back to the origional question, one of my 88GT's is red with gold wheels and a gray interior. 32k mile car that I am restoring to showroom. I think this colour combination is non-typical but not really rare - not sure how many were made like this. My yellow 88GT (1k miles) is considered rare - one of 241 I think - it was also one of a smaller number made for the Canadian market (kilometers vs miles on speedo). I have heard the the rarest colour was silver on the 88GT which was dropped to make way for yellow - anyone know if this is so?<P>Jamie<P><BR> ||||reg||1
